    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA charming red brick period residence in the heart of Dublin 8, boasting elegant original features, two spacious bedrooms and a private rear garden with valuable rear lane access.\n\nA beautifully presented red brick terraced residence of immense character and charm, ideally situated in the heart of Dublin 8, showcasing elegant period features and generous living accommodation throughout.\n\nSavills are delighted to present 7 Greenville Avenue, a most attractive two-bedroom terraced home that seamlessly combines timeless classical design with modern living. Behind its handsome red brick façade lies a welcoming and well-appointed interior, featuring an abundance of original-style detailing including ornate ceiling coving, decorative ceiling roses and feature fireplaces that enhance the property's period appeal.\n\nThe accommodation extends to a bright entrance hallway which leads to an elegant living room, complete with a feature fireplace and beautiful ornate coving. Interconnecting into the dining room, creating an ideal space for both everyday living and entertaining. The dining room also benefits from a beautiful fireplace and flows seamlessly through to the fully fitted kitchen. Finished with integrated appliances, a solid wood counter, a traditional Belfast sink and tiled flooring, the kitchen offers both style and practicality.\n\nTo the rear, a private low-maintenance garden has been thoughtfully designed with timber panelling and a granite slab patio, providing a wonderful outdoor entertaining space. A particularly valuable feature is the rear pedestrian access onto a laneway behind the property.\n\nUpstairs, there are two spacious double bedrooms, both retaining attractive cast iron fireplaces that further reflect the home's character. One of the bedrooms also benefits from fitted wardrobes, providing excellent storage. The family bathroom is fully tiled and is fitted with a bath incorporating an electric shower overhead.\n\n7 Greenville Avenue presents a rare opportunity to acquire a charming period home in one of Dublin 8's most sought-after residential locations. With its wealth of original features, practical layout and attractive rear garden with rear access, this exceptional property is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers seeking a home of distinction within easy reach of the city centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Attractive red brick terraced residence</li><li>Beautiful period detailing throughout</li><li>Built-in wardrobes to one bedroom</li><li>Fully tiled bathroom with electric shower over bath</li><li>Private rear garden with granite slab patio</li><li>Rear pedestrian access onto laneway</li><li>House alarm</li><li>On street residents permit parking</li><li>Gas Fired Central Heating</li><li>Excellent Dublin 8 location close to a host of amenities</ul>"
      },
